B.cKf=new A.y(B.cTP,["The lively acidity and chalky salinity cut through the brine and lift the silky texture of the shellfish.","Gillardeau oyster platter & scallop carpaccio with finger lime","Serve raw at 8-10\xb0C with an olive oil emulsion and citrus zest, without too much vinegar.","The bubbles' lively acidity and saline freshness cut through the brine and lift the silky texture of the shellfish.","Crispy veal sweetbreads with morels and reduced cream","Baste in foaming butter for a golden, crisp outside and a melting centre.","Fine bubbles and brioche notes (yeast autolysis) cleanse the palate of the rich morels and cream.","24-month Comt\xe9 & butter goug\xe8res","Serve the goug\xe8res warm from the oven with slivers of room-temperature Comt\xe9.","The tyrosine crystals of Comt\xe9 echo the creamy bubbles and the wine's oxidative complexity.","Duck foie gras mi-cuit & fig chutney","Serve chilled, in thick slices, with lightly toasted brioche.","The wine's sugar and acidity answer the melting texture of foie gras; the acidity keeps it from cloying.","Roquefort & honey-roasted pear","Take the cheese out 30 minutes ahead; roast the pear for 15 minutes.","A pairing of contrast: the salt and bite of the blue are soothed by the wine's sweetness.","Thin apricot tart & vanilla cream","Choose a dessert less sweet than the wine, or the wine will taste flat.","The wine's apricot and honey notes carry on those of the dessert.","Dark chocolate fondant & candied cherries","Serve warm, with a molten centre, without an over-sweet cream.","The wine's candied fruit and sweetness stand up to the bitterness of cocoa.","Stilton or Fourme d'Ambert & walnuts","Serve the cheese at room temperature.","The wine's alcohol and sugar balance the salt and fat of the blue.","45-day aged rib of beef over wood fire & ma\xeetre d'h\xf4tel butter","Sear over very high heat to caramelise the surface (Maillard reaction), rare at 52\xb0C in the centre.","The meat's proteins and marbling tame the tannins by binding with salivary proline, releasing the fruit.","7-hour leg of lamb with rosemary, black garlic and a rich jus","Cook covered at 120\xb0C for 7 hours. The melted gelatine coats the palate.","The wine's spicy, herbal notes marry perfectly with the aromas of garrigue and rosemary.","Roast duck breast with black cherries and a Sichuan pepper reduction","Score the skin, render at medium heat, then cook flesh side down for 3 minutes.","The natural acidity of black fruit balances the richness of duck.","Pigeon roasted on the crown, celeriac mousseline and truffle jus","Cook precisely to pink. Glaze with the reduced jus mounted with butter.","Silky tannins and forest-floor notes lift the fine flesh of game birds.","Farm pork tenderloin with saut\xe9ed girolles and roasted hazelnuts","Cook gently to 58\xb0C in the centre; dry-fry the girolles, then add butter at the end.","Forest-floor notes and tangy red fruit blend in without overpowering the delicate meat.","Bluefin tuna tataki with black sesame & duck jus with pink peppercorns","30 seconds per side on a scorching plancha. Raw, silky centre.","A supple red without heavy tannins makes a bold surf-and-turf pairing with no metallic taste.","Roast wild sea bass, braised fennel and whisked beurre blanc","Cook skin side down until crisp. Whisk the beurre blanc off the heat.","Lively tartaric acidity cuts through the rich beurre blanc while bringing out the fish's briny minerality.","Warm Crottin de Chavignol on country bread & lamb's lettuce with walnuts","Grill for 4 minutes until the top of the cheese turns golden.","The wine's green, mineral freshness lifts the lactic texture of the goat's cheese.","Sea bass tartare with passion fruit and fresh coriander","Plate at the last minute, very cold, to keep crunch and freshness.","The wine's freshness and citrus notes echo the acidity of passion fruit.","Roast blue lobster in brown butter & morel emulsion","Pan-fry the lobster meat gently and coat with a rich, creamy shell jus.","The wine's roundness and breadth wrap the natural sweetness of the lobster.","Roast Bresse chicken with vin jaune and morels","Poach, then roast gently for very tender meat.","The wine's power and rich texture hold up to the creamy sauce.","Langoustine ravioli in a Thai lemongrass and coconut milk broth","Serve the steaming broth around the delicate ravioli.","The wine's floral and fruity notes answer the lemongrass and coconut.","Grilled red mullet with rosemary and crushed potatoes in olive oil","Cook very quickly, skin side down, on a very hot plancha.","The ros\xe9's light phenolic texture and salinity support the strong, briny flavour of red mullet.","Traditional Proven\xe7al stuffed vegetables & minced lamb with herbs","Slow-bake at 160\xb0C for 45 minutes to concentrate the juices.","The fruity acidity refreshes the palate after each bite of soft vegetables and stuffing.","Beef tataki with coriander seeds and mild chilli oil","Serve cool in thin slices with a light citrus dressing.","The ros\xe9's spicy side goes with the freshness of raw beef without weighing it down.","Board of artisan charcuterie & aged local cheeses","Take the cheeses and charcuterie out 30 minutes before serving, to reach room temperature.","The balance of salt, fat and texture echoes the wine's structure.","Speciality oysters","Scallops","Finger lime","Veal sweetbreads","Fresh morels","Raw cream","Brown butter","24-month Comt\xe9","Choux pastry","Swiss Gruy\xe8re","Sichuan pepper","Duck foie gras","Figs","Brioche","Pear","Honey","Walnuts","Apricots","Puff pastry","Vanilla","Almonds","70% dark chocolate","Cherries","Butter","Cocoa","Blue cheese","Raisin bread","Simmental or Black Angus beef","Gu\xe9rande salt","Fresh thyme","Bone marrow","Sisteron lamb","Fresh rosemary","Candied black garlic","Reduced brown stock","South-West duck breast","Morello cherries","Cracked pepper","Aged balsamic vinegar","Farm pigeon","Celeriac","Unsalted butter","P\xe9rigord black truffle","Pork tenderloin","Fresh girolles","Flat-leaf parsley","Crushed hazelnuts","Fresh bluefin tuna","Sesame seeds","Reduced soy sauce","Pink peppercorn","Line-caught sea bass","Wild fennel","Grey shallot","Dry white wine","Aged Chavignol","Sourdough bread","Fresh lamb's lettuce","Walnut oil","Sea bass flesh","Passion fruit","Coriander","Shallot","Breton lobster","Salted butter","Double cream","PDO farm-raised poularde","Morels","Isigny cream","Shallots","Coconut milk","Lemongrass","Mild ginger","Fresh red mullet","Rosemary","PDO olive oil","Round courgettes","Tomatoes","Lamb","Summer savory","Beef fillet","Mild Espelette pepper","Chives","Cured ham","Raw-milk cheese","Gherkins"],t.w)
